        1320
      ],
      "start": 819.26,
      "end": 820.06
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, I remember that when we were kids, we often walked, rode a bike, or caught the bus to school.",
      "asr_range": [
        1320,
        1340
      ],
      "start": 820.3,
      "end": 826.62
    },
    {
      "en": "Few of us were dropped off at the school gate by our parents.",
      "asr_range": [
        1340,
        1353
      ],
      "start": 826.86,
      "end": 830.22
    },
    {
      "en": "I see what you mean.",
      "asr_range": [
        1353,
        1358
      ],
      "start": 831.06,
      "end": 832.74
    },
    {
      "en": "These days you can see traffic jams around schools at drop-off and pick-up times.",
      "asr_range": [
        1358,
        1374
      ],
      "start": 832.98,
      "end": 838.66
    },
    {
      "en": "But it's hard to blame the parents.",
      "asr_range": [
        1374,
        1381
      ],
      "start": 838.9,
      "end": 840.98
    },
    {
      "en": "They have good reasons for driving their kids to school, mostly to do with safety and convenience.",
      "asr_range": [
        1381,
        1398
      ],
      "start": 841.22,
      "end": 847.3
    },
    {
      "en": "You have a point there, but it could also mean children are missing out on much-needed exercise and other life skills.",
      "asr_range": [
        1398,
        1420
      ],
      "start": 847.97,
      "end": 855.25
    },
    {
      "en": "Some parents are just being overprotective, with their children learning nothing but living in fear of everything.",
      "asr_range": [
        1420,
        1437
      ],
      "start": 855.49,
      "end": 862.21
    },
    {
      "en": "Studies have found that children who spend more time outside tend to be healthier, better-adjusted, and better at dealing with stress.",
      "asr_range": [
        1437,
        1459
      ],
      "start": 862.84,
      "end": 871.16
    },
    {
      "en": "So, Marie, your kitchen garden looks excellent.",
      "asr_range": [
        1474,
        1481
      ],
      "start": 926.37,
      "end": 929.97
    },
    {
      "en": "What made you turn to social media to record your vegetable growing?",
      "asr_range": [
        1481,
        1493
      ],
      "start": 930.21,
      "end": 934.21
    },
    {
      "en": "Initially, I used the online platform as a diary, something to look back on, giving me a sense of achievement and keeping me motivated and moving forward.",
      "asr_range": [
        1493,
        1520
      ],
      "start": 934.77,
      "end": 944.84
    },
    {
      "en": "As time went by, other gardeners and like-minded people began to follow my progress too.",
      "asr_range": [
        1520,
        1536
      ],
      "start": 945.08,
      "end": 951.32
    },
    {
      "en": "I know you grow lots of fruit on your land.",
      "asr_range": [
        1536,
        1546
      ],
      "start": 951.88,
      "end": 954.44
    },
    {
      "en": "Which would you recommend to beginners as the best to grow?",
      "asr_range": [
        1546,
        1557
      ],
      "start": 955.13,
      "end": 958.25
    },
    {
      "en": "Strawberries would be a good choice.",
      "asr_range": [
        1557,
        1563
      ],
      "start": 958.73,
      "end": 960.89
    },
    {
      "en": "They produce a lot of fruit in their first season.",
      "asr_range": [
        1563,
        1573
      ],
      "start": 961.13,
      "end": 964.41
    },
    {
      "en": "That's cool.",
      "asr_range": [
        1573,
        1575
      ],
      "start": 964.65,
      "end": 965.53
    },
    {
      "en": "Well, do you have plans to try new or any particular crops next year?",
      "asr_range": [
        1575,
        1589
      ],
      "start": 965.77,
      "end": 970.33
    },
    {
      "en": "Next season I will be adding some pear trees to the fruit area.",
      "asr_range": [
        1589,
        1602
      ],
      "start": 971.11,
      "end": 975.03
    },
    {
      "en": "I will be adding more herbs which I can use in the kitchen.",
      "asr_range": [
        1602,
        1615
      ],
      "start": 975.59,
      "end": 978.63
    },
    {
      "en": "And, after a couple of years of failure, I will try growing carrots again.",
      "asr_range": [
        1615,
        1629
      ],
      "start": 979.27,
      "end": 984.31
    },
    {
      "en": "What advice would you offer someone thinking of doing kitchen gardening?",
      "asr_range": [
        1629,
